# A misspelled join kind: DS0123 with a did-you-mean fix.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | join kind = fullouterr 'customers.csv' on customerId
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..73
  PIPELINE@0..72
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    LITERAL@5..17
      STRING@5..17 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 " "
    PIPE@18..19 "|"
    WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
    JOIN_OP@20..72
      IDENT@20..24 "join"
      WHITESPACE@24..25 " "
      JOIN_KIND@25..42
        IDENT@25..29 "kind"
        WHITESPACE@29..30 " "
        EQ@30..31 "="
        WHITESPACE@31..32 " "
        IDENT@32..42 "fullouterr"
      WHITESPACE@42..43 " "
      LITERAL@43..58
        STRING@43..58 "'customers.csv'"
      WHITESPACE@58..59 " "
      IDENT@59..61 "on"
      WHITESPACE@61..62 " "
      NAME_REF@62..72
        IDENT@62..72 "customerId"
  WHITESPACE@72..73 "\n"

error[DS0123]: unknown join kind `fullouterr`
  --> query:1:33
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | join kind = fullouterr 'customers.csv' on customerId
  |                                 ^^^^^^^^^^ not a join kind
  |
  = help: write `kind = fullouter`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv' | join kind = fullouter 'customers.csv' on customerId
which parses without errors
